Stage07 Demo06: FFmpeg vs GStreamer mental model
[mapping]
FFmpeg input/filter/output model  <->  GStreamer element/pad/caps model
FFmpeg decoder selection          <->  GStreamer decoder element selection
FFmpeg hwaccel/hwdownload         <->  GStreamer hardware element + memory caps + sink

