output_end

[driver shadow]
If FFmpeg hardware path works but GStreamer fails, compare backend plugin, parser, caps, and sink memory type.
If both fail on the same compressed stream, suspect bitstream/profile/backend/driver/device support earlier.
verdict=PASS_FFMPEG_GSTREAMER_COMPARE
